      "source": "Writing converter for Enums. This is registered in\n<a href=\"../../config/AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration.html#customConversions(com.couchbase.client.core.encryption.CryptoManager,com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper)\"><code>AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration.customConversions(CryptoManager, ObjectMapper)</code></a>.\nThe corresponding reading converters are in\n<a href=\"IntegerToEnumConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert\"><code>IntegerToEnumConverterFactory</code></a> and\n<a href=\"StringToEnumConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert\"><code>StringToEnumConverterFactory</code></a>",
      "translation": "用于枚举的写入转换器。该转换器注册在\n<a href=\"../../config/AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration.html#customConversions(com.couchbase.client.core.encryption.CryptoManager,com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper)\"><code>AbstractCouchbaseConfiguration.customConversions(CryptoManager, ObjectMapper)</code></a> 中。\n相应的读取转换器位于\n<a href=\"IntegerToEnumConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert\"><code>IntegerToEnumConverterFactory</code></a> 和\n<a href=\"StringToEnumConverterFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.couchbase.core.convert\"><code>StringToEnumConverterFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
